# PROJECT MEMORY: branding-dadik
# Generated: 2026-01-19
# Purpose: Complete project analysis and structure documentation

================================================================================
## PROJECT OVERVIEW
================================================================================

Name: branding-dadik
Type: Personal Branding Website / Landing Page
Owner: Dadik Wahyu Chang (Strategic Brand Consultant)
Company: UTERO Indonesia
Location: Rumah Merah OXYZ, Malang, Indonesia
Established: Since 1998

### PROJECT MISSION
Helping businesses transition from "Commodities" to "Legacies" through the 
fusion of Creative Strategy & Legal Protection (HAKI/Intellectual Property).

### BRAND PHILOSOPHY
- Color Identity: RED (Merah) - Represents passion, optimism, and courage
- Tagline: "Branding Bukan Akting" (Branding is Not Acting)
- Motto: "Ide tanpa realisasi adalah sampah" (Ideas without execution are garbage)

