================================================================================
## DESIGN SYSTEM
================================================================================

### Color Palette (CSS Variables in globals.css)
--primary:        #D71920  (Bold Red - Brand Color)
--background:     #FFFFFF  (White)
--background-alt: #F9FAFB  (Light Grey)
--foreground:     #111111  (Almost Black - Headings)
--text-body:      #4B5563  (Grey - Body Text)

### Typography
- Font Family: Inter (Google Font)
- CSS Variable: --font-inter
- Headings: Foreground color (#111111)
- Body: Text-body color (#4B5563)

### Component Variants (Button.tsx)
- primary:  Red background, white text
- outline:  Red border, red text
- ghost:    Text only, hover red
- white:    White background, red text

================================================================================
## PAGE SECTIONS (in order)
================================================================================

1. NAVBAR (Navbar.tsx)
   - Fixed position, transparent -> white on scroll
   - Logo: "DWC." with animated red dot
   - Navigation links with scroll spy active state
   - Framer Motion hover pill animation
   - Mobile hamburger menu with fullscreen overlay
   - CTA: "Ngopi & Diskusi" (Coffee & Discuss) -> WhatsApp

2. HERO (Hero.tsx + HeroImageSlider.tsx)
   - Full red background
   - Tagline: "Mitra Strategis Brand untuk Pemilik Visioner"
   - Subtitle about transitioning businesses
   - Two CTAs: Schedule Consultation + View Portfolio
   - Right side: Animated image slider with 4 layouts:
     * Collage (cluster arrangement)
     * Masonry (staggered vertical)
     * Cards (row arrangement)
     * Geometric (circle + shapes)
   - Auto-rotates every 3 seconds

3. SOCIAL PROOF (SocialProof.tsx)
   - Grey background bar
   - "Partner Komunitas" label
   - Partner logos: ICCN, MCF, ADGI, AAM
   - Grayscale filter on logos

4. PHILOSOPHY (Philosophy.tsx + PhilosophyImageSlider.tsx)
   - Section ID: #philosophy
   - Title: "Branding Bukan Akting"
   - Extended personal story/bio about Dadik Wahyu Chang
   - Left side: Grid of 15 personal photos (2-3 columns)
   - Story covers: background, education, mission, community work

5. METHODOLOGY (Methodology.tsx)
   - Section ID: #methodology
   - Title: "Kerangka Strategis" (Strategic Framework)
   - Three strategic maps:
     * Brand W Strategic Map
     * Branding Model Canvas
     * Blueprint Kota Kreatif (Creative City Blueprint)

6. SERVICES (Services.tsx)
   - Section ID: #services
   - 4 service cards in grid:
     * Diskusi Strategis (Strategic Discussion)
     * Identitas & Arahan Visual (Identity & Visual Direction)
     * Mentoring Hukum & HAKI (Legal & IP Mentoring)
     * Workshop Brand (Brand Workshop)
   - Each with icon from Lucide React

7. CLIENTS (Clients.tsx)
   - Section ID: #clients
   - Single image showing all client logos

8. JOURNEY (Journey.tsx)
   - Section ID: #journey
   - Timeline from 1998-2025
   - Alternating left/right layout on desktop
   - Vertical line with markers
   - 10 time periods with detailed activities
   - Notable clients: Mie Gacoan, Ayam Nelongso, multiple cities, etc.

9. LEGACY (Legacy.tsx)
   - Dark grey background
   - Title: "Mesin Eksekusi" (Execution Machine)
   - Promotes UTERO INDONESIA
   - Glow effects and pattern background
   - CTA to visit uteroindonesia.com

10. AWARDS (Awards.tsx)
    - Section ID: #award
    - Trophy image on left
    - 6 notable achievements listed
    - Includes Sampoerna Foundation, Bank Mandiri, EXPO 2020 Dubai

11. DOWNLOAD (Download.tsx)
    - Section ID: #download
    - Two columns:
      * CV Download (PDF link)
      * E-book "Balik Jungkir" purchase (WhatsApp)

12. CONTACT (Contact.tsx)
    - Section ID: #contact
    - Casual invitation: "Punya Ide Liar? Mari Kita Wujudkan"
    - Two CTAs:
      * WhatsApp: "Ngopi & Diskusi"
      * Email: hello@dadikwahyuchang.id

13. FOOTER (Footer.tsx)
    - Black background
    - Name and title
    - Location: Rumah Merah OXYZ, Malang
    - Copyright 2026

================================================================================
## REUSABLE COMPONENTS
================================================================================

### Button (Button.tsx)
- Supports: href (Link) or button mode
- Variants: primary, outline, ghost, white
- Features: hover scale, active scale
- Props: children, variant, className, href, target

### Reveal (Reveal.tsx)
- Scroll-triggered animation wrapper
- Uses Framer Motion + useInView
- Props: width, delay, duration, yOffset, className
- Default: 0.25s delay, 0.5s duration, 75px y-offset

================================================================================
## ANIMATIONS
================================================================================

### Framer Motion Usage
- Hero stagger children animations
- Navbar hover pill with layoutId
- Mobile menu entrance/exit
- HeroImageSlider layout transitions
- All sections use Reveal component for entrance

### CSS Transitions
- Button hover/active scale
- Navbar background on scroll
- Service card hover effects
- Image hover zoom

